# Spree (CR 702.172): only the chosen modes are paid for and happen, each with its own target. Modes 1 and 3 ({G} + {2} + {1})
# are chosen, the trample mode is not: the counters go on Llanowar Elves (3/3, no trample) and the draw-two grant on Haywire Mite,
# a different creature. Both attack Bot2 unblocked: the Mite's combat damage draws two cards, the Elves' damage draws nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Haywire Mite
Trash the Town
Island x3
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

